@startuml
actor Frontend as FE
participant "CommentController" as Controller
participant "CommentService" as Service

FE -> Controller: 发起评论请求
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: 检查用户登录状态
Controller -> Controller: 记录评论日志
Controller -> Service: 根据评论ID获取原评论信息
activate Service

Service --> Controller: 返回原评论信息
Controller -> Service: 更新原评论的回复时间和回复内容
Service --> Controller: 返回更新结果
Controller -> Service: 调用saveOrUpdate方法保存或更新评论记录
Service --> Controller: 返回保存或更新结果
Controller --> FE: 返回评论结果
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
@enduml
